  <name>ADT_to_FHIR_Patient</name>
  <description>HL7 v2 ADT to FHIR R4 Patient. Demo channel for synthetic test data only.

Source: MLLP listener on port 6661. The ACK is sent after the destination has finished: AA = converted, AR = filtered (not an accepted ADT event), AE = error.

Destination &quot;FHIR app&quot;: the filter accepts ADT A01, A04, A05, A08, A28 and A31. The transformer copies PID-3, PID-5, PID-7, PID-8, PID-11 and PID-13 into JSON. The HTTP Sender posts that JSON to http://fhir-logic-service:3000/convert/patient, which returns the FHIR Patient.</description>
